+$NetBSD$
+
+CVE-2022-45939: etags -u ran "mv ... OTAGS; fgrep ..." through the shell
+with the file name unquoted, so a crafted file name ran commands.  Do the
+work in C instead.  Same fix as Emacs 28.2, adapted by Debian for XEmacs.
